content.text:
The profile service is the single root cause. Its deployment never had an available replica after 10:27:35 and stayed at zero through the end of the window, so the frontend's profile calls fail and its user-facing HTTP requests return 500.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "profile",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT time, service_name, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.deployment.available' AND service_name='profile' ORDER BY time", "claim": "profile deployment available is 0 from 10:27:35 onward, through the end of the abnormal window"},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT time, attr_k8s_pod_name, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'profile-%' ORDER BY time", "claim": "the profile pod's restart counter climbs from 2 to 6 while the deployment never becomes available"},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='profile' GROUP BY 1", "claim": "profile emits zero spans in the abnormal window, against 1184 in the normal window"},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='profile.Profile/GetProfiles' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "all 856 frontend calls to profile.Profile/GetProfiles error in about 0.01 ms, versus 0.55 ms successful in normal"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "profile",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_http_response_status_code, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND span_name IN ('HTTP /hotels','HTTP /recommendations') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend HTTP /hotels and /recommendations return 500 on every request, 856 requests in total, while profile is down"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

